  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"\"><mi>Cu</mi></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"\"><mi>Zn</mi></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.1</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>So If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.1</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;no electron will flow</p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;cell act as electrolytic cell and electron will flow from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi></math>.</p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;cell act as electrochemical so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi></math>&nbsp;dissolve and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi></math>&nbsp;deposit.</p>",
